// "Send Questionnaire by Email" button body (Setup > Deals > Buttons > New Custom Button >
// Action Type = Writing Function). Calls the real named Custom Function
// (sendPreNeedQuestionnaireEmail.deluge, created separately under Setup > Automation >
// Functions) and shows the result. standalone. prefix per this org's established
// convention for cross-calling a standalone Custom Function.
response = standalone.sendPreNeedQuestionnaireEmail(deal.id);
respMap = response.toMap();
alert ifnull(respMap.get("message"),"Finished.");
